Subject: [PATCH] media: xilinx: dprxss: select the DRM KMS helpers

The DisplayPort receive driver selects DRM's display and DP helpers. These
reference the KMS atomic and hotplug helpers even when no display controller
is enabled. Select the shared helper library explicitly so capture-only
configurations link without an unrelated display driver selecting it.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/Kconfig
@@ -159,6 +159,7 @@ config VIDEO_XILINX_DPRXSS
 	depends on VIDEO_XILINX
 	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
 	select DRM_DISPLAY_DP_HELPER
+	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
 	select MFD_SYSCON
 	help
 	  Driver for Xilinx DisplayPort Rx Subsystem. This is a V4L sub-device
